{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804970/extras/99df6e894b1009f3687fedac96b91690.poster.avif?t=1772545741\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804970/extras/99df6e894b1009f3687fedac96b91690.webm?t=1772545741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804970/extras/99df6e894b1009f3687fedac96b91690.mp4?t=1772545741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Isometric / Action RPG / Stamina Management / Action Tower Defense</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Impactful and Varied Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand against dark forces with a combat system that is challenging yet fair. Dedicate your successful quests to the Pantheon and gain their blessings. Gather various divine relics and tap their powers. Do you want to be a Sanctified Juggernaut, smashing evil into fragments? An Unyielding Stalwart, watching while wicked washes off your proud armor? The choice is yours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804970/extras/933f85c4fc7ca1e161a710be7ebd578d.poster.avif?t=1772545741\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804970/extras/933f85c4fc7ca1e161a710be7ebd578d.webm?t=1772545741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804970/extras/933f85c4fc7ca1e161a710be7ebd578d.mp4?t=1772545741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend your Fortress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your successful quests draw the ire of the local Warlords. A challenge issued; and one the Warlords are happy to respond to. Hold fast against the armies brought to bear against the Paladin Order's Fort. However, wielding a fast blade will not be enough to prevail. Utilize traps, turrets and barricades devised by the clever members of your Order, while the stronger members will follow your orders on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804970/extras/8cc490c49849f8e1e87aee3a3e052297.poster.avif?t=1772545741\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804970/extras/8cc490c49849f8e1e87aee3a3e052297.webm?t=1772545741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804970/extras/8cc490c49849f8e1e87aee3a3e052297.mp4?t=1772545741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rebuild Your Shattered Order</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Titus and his Order venture deeper into the Crater, there are opportunities to add valuable skills to the fledgling Order. Recruit, rescue or persuade those whose skills may give the Order another edge against evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Apprentice Paladin's Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Titus follows his Master and their foundling Order and descends into the Crater, an ugly scar gouged into the heart of the Old Empire. As a Paladin Acolyte, Titus is still learning the blade and deciding whether a Paladin's life is for him. When the Crater turns out to be far more dangerous than they expected, the new Order must band together to survive.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2804970?t=1772545741","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2804970?t=1772545741","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804970/ba3ccef59c8cf506e9081de2f372f4ced4f53ac0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772545741","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804970/ba3ccef59c8cf506e9081de2f372f4ced4f53ac0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772545741","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Frontier Paladin contains acts of violence. Sometimes by the player, sometimes done to NPCs or to the player. There are also mentions and depictions of alcohol and drug usage."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3114540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804970/extras/99df6e894b1009f3687fedac96b91690.poster.avif?t=1772545741\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804970/extras/99df6e894b1009f3687fedac96b91690.webm?t=1772545741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804970/extras/99df6e894b1009f3687fedac96b91690.mp4?t=1772545741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Isometric / Action RPG / Stamina Management / Action Tower Defense</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Impactful and Varied Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand against dark forces with a combat system that is challenging yet fair. Dedicate your successful quests to the Pantheon and gain their blessings. Gather various divine relics and tap their powers. Do you want to be a Sanctified Juggernaut, smashing evil into fragments? An Unyielding Stalwart, watching while wicked washes off your proud armor? The choice is yours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804970/extras/933f85c4fc7ca1e161a710be7ebd578d.poster.avif?t=1772545741\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804970/extras/933f85c4fc7ca1e161a710be7ebd578d.webm?t=1772545741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804970/extras/933f85c4fc7ca1e161a710be7ebd578d.mp4?t=1772545741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend your Fortress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your successful quests draw the ire of the local Warlords. A challenge issued; and one the Warlords are happy to respond to. Hold fast against the armies brought to bear against the Paladin Order's Fort. However, wielding a fast blade will not be enough to prevail. Utilize traps, turrets and barricades devised by the clever members of your Order, while the stronger members will follow your orders on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804970/extras/8cc490c49849f8e1e87aee3a3e052297.poster.avif?t=1772545741\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804970/extras/8cc490c49849f8e1e87aee3a3e052297.webm?t=1772545741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804970/extras/8cc490c49849f8e1e87aee3a3e052297.mp4?t=1772545741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rebuild Your Shattered Order</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Titus and his Order venture deeper into the Crater, there are opportunities to add valuable skills to the fledgling Order. Recruit, rescue or persuade those whose skills may give the Order another edge against evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Apprentice Paladin's Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Titus follows his Master and their foundling Order and descends into the Crater, an ugly scar gouged into the heart of the Old Empire. As a Paladin Acolyte, Titus is still learning the blade and deciding whether a Paladin's life is for him. When the Crater turns out to be far more dangerous than they expected, the new Order must band together to survive.</p>","developers":["Singular Scheme"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804970/6f08b1186cc5234cc40a14fc9c89b4546926b94c/header.jpg?t=1772545741","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2804970/681600336/e0b1238157afb851b7556a568319d58579fa7c8c/1758874724/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758877405","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2804970/681600336/e0b1238157afb851b7556a568319d58579fa7c8c/1758874724/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758877405","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/